    "title": "Durian Furniture is Hiring: Floor Manager (Junior)",
    "description": "Durian Furniture has an exciting opening for a Floor Manager at our Varanasi office. Join a company that values innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning.\n\nAbout Durian Furniture:\nDurian Furniture is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Build relationships with regular customers to drive loyalty\n• Conduct regular stock audits and prevent pilferage\n• Handle customer queries, complaints, and escalations effectively\n• Maintain high standards of store hygiene and cleanliness\n• Prepare daily sales reports and share insights with management\n• Train and motivate the sales team to deliver excellent service\n• Ensure compliance with company policies and retail regulations\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Any graduate with relevant experience\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Inventory Management\n• Proficiency in SAP Retail\n• Proficiency in POS Systems\n• Proficiency in Omnichannel Retail\n• Proficiency in Shrinkage Control\n• Proficiency in Loss Prevention\n• Proficiency in Visual Merchandising\n• Proficiency in Retail Analytics\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Flexible working hours\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Learning & development budget\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Varanasi, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Durian Furniture!",
